<title>JAPAN: Hamai -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hamai -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.60		vs	    1.99</p>
<p> Operating	  110    million	  vs	   28    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 57 million	  vs    loss 58    million</p>
<p> Net		   42    million	  vs	   43    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.57 yen	  vs	    1.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  27 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Hamai Co Ltd is a well-established machine tool maker, especially in the areas of hobbing and precision machines.</p>
